### Feature CashRegister (TurnoCaja) — GET ALL / GET ONE (JWT + RBAC)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = {{login.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### LOGIN como admin (ejecutar PRIMERO: guarda el token en @token)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### GET ALL
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/turnos-caja
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET ONE
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/turnos-caja/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
